; Merz ion Lennard-Jones parameter reference library
; Generated from user-provided primary literature PDFs.
; Only elemental metal ions are included; molecular ions and halide anions are excluded.
; Source AMBER-style Rmin/2 (Angstrom) and epsilon (kcal/mol) were converted to
; GROMACS combination-rule-2 [ atomtypes ] sigma (nm) and epsilon (kJ/mol):
; sigma = 2*(Rmin/2)/2^(1/6)*0.1 ; epsilon = epsilon_kcal*4.184
; Atomtype names use element symbol + oxidation state (e.g. Fe3, Al3, Zn2).
; Multiple candidate parameter lines for the same ion may therefore share the same atomtype name;
; select only the parameter compatible with the intended parameter set and water model.
;
; References
; ref2: Li, P.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2014, 10, 289-297. DOI: 10.1021/ct400751u
; ref3: Li, P.; Song, L. F.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Phys. Chem. B 2015, 119, 883-895. DOI: 10.1021/jp505875v
; ref4: Li, P.; Song, L. F.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2015, 11, 1645-1657. DOI: 10.1021/ct500918t
; ref5: Li, Z.; Song, L. F.; Li, P.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2020. DOI: 10.1021/acs.jctc.0c00194
; ref6: Li, Z.; Song, L. F.; Li, P.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2021, 17, 2342-2354. DOI: 10.1021/acs.jctc.0c01320
; ref7: Sengupta, A.; Li, Z.; Song, L. F.; Li, P.; Merz, K. M., Jr. J. Chem. Inf. Model. 2021, 61, 869-880. DOI: 10.1021/acs.jcim.0c01390
; ref8: Sengupta, A.; Li, Z.; Song, L. F.; Li, P.; Merz, K. M., Jr. Correction. J. Chem. Inf. Model. 2021, 61, 3734-3735. DOI: 10.1021/acs.jcim.1c00576
;
; NOTE: standard GROMACS [ atomtypes ] stores the 12-6 part only.
; The line comment preserves the metal-water-oxygen C4 value from the cited source,
; converted from kcal mol^-1 Angstrom^4 to kJ mol^-1 nm^4 (factor 4.184e-4).
; A selected 12-6-4 implementation must apply the C4 term separately.
;
[ atomtypes ]
; name                               at.num       mass    charge ptype      sigma(nm)      epsilon(kJ/mol) ; set | water model | source | C4(M-Owater)
